<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 480 MLN NBP-BILLS. [CORRECTED 12:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 480 MLN NBP-BILLS. [CORRECTED 12:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects figure in headline to 480 mln from 380 mln.)</p>
<p>Polish banks bid for 300 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills and for 180 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
